            <li><strong>Phase II: The Guardian Algorithm.</strong> We will develop a software layer acting as a digital <span class="keyword-highlight">constable</span>. This AI-driven agent will monitor environmental safety and user physiological signals to ensure that any deviation from a safe state (e.g., a fall or a sudden spike in stress) triggers immediate, automated assistance.</li>
            <li><strong>Phase III: User Integration.</strong> Testing the interface with a diverse cohort of participants to measure improvements in perceived autonomy and reduction in daily fatigue.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Expected Outcomes</h2>
        <p>
